## Commercial Purposes

Commercial Purposes means:

(a) using the software for the primary purpose of deriving commercial advantage
    or pecuniary payment;

(b) offering the software as a paid service, or behind a paywall, or integrated
    into a commercial product or service; or

(c) operating an instance of the software for profit.

Hosting an instance for yourself, your friends, family, open community game
nights, educational institutions, or non-commercial entertainment is fully
permitted.

